category: Libs
requires: cygwin libcamd3 libcholmod5 libcxsparse4 libgcc1 libGL1 libGLU1 libstdc++6
sdesc: "General Framework for Graph Optimization (runtime)"
ldesc: "g2o is an open-source C++ framework for optimizing graph-based nonlinear error
functions. g2o has been designed to be easily extensible to a wide range of
problems and a new problem typically can be specified in a few lines of code.
The current implementation provides solutions to several variants of SLAM and
BA."
external-source: g2o

